{
  "title": "Zesty Tender Venezuelan Shrimp Skewers",
  "description": "A peppery and tender Venezuelan dish featuring lemongrass stalks and a mirepoix base, perfect for a dairy-free friendly date night.",
  "cuisine": "Venezuelan",
  "diet": [
    "dairy-free",
